Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After our battle with the Frog\NFiends, we headed back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we didn't run into any issues on\Nthe return trip, but when we got there…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry everybody, I\Nknow that you're tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems we have one\Nmore matter to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munami and Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's known them for\Na lot longer than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way I can help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look forward, please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, forward there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.86,0:00:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look forward, please insert coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should look forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here and do nothing!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:30.56,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not supposed to be a lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.12,0:02:33.96,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,768)\fscx64}Rebuilding
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like something got\Ndragged through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could something like this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the inn okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mrs! Murder me! Ah, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she'll run inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would have responded\Nif they were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means they evacuated somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one place they'd\Ngo at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know just the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lammis and Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karios, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you guys made it\Nback safely. We've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, before you go asking,\Nthey're both all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where the transfer circle is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the safest place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village was built inside of a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for it\Nto have all these defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.47,0:03:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had quite the exciting\Ntime while you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys finish the request?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize so many faces around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only lived here a few weeks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to lose any of them as\Nsomeone who's already died once I can't help
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but feel That way all\Ngoods are on me today
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come and get it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon came to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that this two-headed Snake monster is\Napparently a natural predator of the frogmen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the fat makes the meat taste super.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yummy whoa they eat the\Nmonsters they kill I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess when you live in a dungeon you've\Ngot to be Pretty wild I I mean resilient it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems I managed to attract a couple new
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,customers with today's\Nfree Giveaway the alcoholic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drink I just stocked is selling like crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with the potato chips And odin enjoy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.56,0:04:54.06,sign_29945_459_Oden,text (lower left can),0,0,0,,{\pos(220,20)\fs30\c&H8C715F&\3c&H3B1C17&}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the free stuff while you can because after\Ntomorrow I'm gonna earn tons of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to experience so many new things\Nsince we went on that expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That alone made it all worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though half the village was\Ndestroyed, everything turned out A-OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved that you\Nfound your place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see how long that line was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid they wouldn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, before I knew it, you\Nbecame friends with everybody. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I was worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was worried about my well-being?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She really is a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep well, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The merchants are always busy in the\Nmorning getting their shops ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As expected, there are lots of carpenters\Nas well as hunters on guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everyone's got to eat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear sent summons for Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why, but I hope it's to\Nreward her for the successful expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good news, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The director asked me to personally\Nhelp out with a special request!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there! Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be cleaning up rumble around town!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your blessing is gonna\Ncome in handy for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be relying on you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this where we were assigned?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's the box with\Nthe mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great. Lucky us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the pay is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll buy a whole bunch of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cart's all full.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of her blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas gained a reputation\Nof being a screw-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so her fellow hunters\Ntreated her like a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps if she'd been\Ngiven more jobs like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they would have seen the\Nupsides of her blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're hard at work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you youngsters might be hungry\Nafter looking around all this junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose whatever you'd like from Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, naturally that goes\Nfor you ladies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're fine, then I'll have\None of these and one of those, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, Lamy, at times like this, you\Nshould pick the most expensive things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you so generously offered, why\Ndon't we start with a hundred soups?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, let's be reasonable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I wanted to ask\Nif you would join our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for Boxo, too, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world would you say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was an invitation to\Njoin the Menagerie of Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we need all the help we\Ncan get rebuilding the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:08:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run off like that\Nbefore the repairs are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you be Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, the strange magic\Nartifact with a mind of its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that phrase is\Nyour way of saying yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, I'm back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I didn't mean to\Ninterrupt you. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Acowi from the Exchange House.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Gokai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we received word that this stratum\Nwas running low on silver coins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we came to investigate the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems someone out there\Nis hoarding silver coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's because everyone\Npays Boxxo in silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell them that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case, I\Nhave a proposal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've brought along nearly a\Nhundred gold coins with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind exchanging\Nthem for your silver coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remember right, each\Nis worth a hundred silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you convert it to yen, I'd\Nsay it's about a hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a ton of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you don't accept the offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't want to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't have any way of\Nexchanging currencies right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, maybe if you buy something with a\Ngold coin, you can get silver's exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ho, ho, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first gold coin I've accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this may actually work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep buying more items.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I got put through the\Ndamn ringer thanks to that jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we continue on, we might\Nstart to interfere with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxer's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have more coins, but\Nwe'll exchange them next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to working with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be the richest\Nbox thingy in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better be careful to not get robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to papa.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.95,0:10:06.62,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\pos(545,125)}Vending
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.95,0:10:06.62,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\c&H4D4C4E&\an2\pos(490,170)\fs20}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm finally able to use this\Nparticular phrase for its intended purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I added the digital lottery function.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I installed it,\NI've increased sales by 30%.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the last one, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'm\Nbound to win something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd even wager this old life\Nof mine on this final shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you going on\Nabout this time, you old fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bad habit of yours\Nis rearing its ugly head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, I bet you don't\Nremember what day today is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do. I remember. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent a letter to Hulemy,\Nbut she hasn't responded yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's probably wandering\Naround a stratum somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, could you keep waiting\Nhere for a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:10:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you too busy right now? Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have a chat with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you visit the Hunter Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mentioned this to you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You both performed well\Nduring the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without your quick thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a high probability the situation\Nwould have gone from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I have a small favor.\NI'd like to ask you, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, would you mind giving\Nus a bit of privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.47,0:11:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll just wait downstairs, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send for you as soon\Nas our business is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recently, a large number of people have\Nbeen hoping to migrate to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But increasing the population\Nbrings a number of issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of which is food, but you\Ncan help alleviate any shortages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, there are other concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hygiene being particularly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bear fiends don't\Nhave many physical needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside of mating season, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame humans aren't so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're susceptible to\Nthings like diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which could delay reconstruction efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kind of a sensitive\Nsubject, so he had Lamas leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, as a former human\Nmyself, it's just natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come inside, Shirley?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's lovely to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ideally, allowing more people to live\Nin the village would be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as the population grows,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to tighten health regulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which can then create more\Nproblems down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.18,0:12:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got something in mind\Nfor preventing diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the question is, will\Nthey be able to understand it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I might as well show it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is how you go about\Nchanging the products you sell.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.42,0:12:57.88,sign_18616_210_Outlet,text,0,0,0,,{\frz11.11\fax-0.3\pos(375,130)\fsp6}OUTLET
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:13:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's inside this package?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this how you plan to\Nstop the spread of disease?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.34,0:13:04.30,sign_18758_213_Firm_Fit,text,0,0,0,,F{\c&H397F94&}i{\c&H418DA1&}r{\c&H499AAE&}m {\c&H58B4C9&}F{\c&H60C2D6&}i{\c&H68CFE3&}t
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.46,0:13:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten silver coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly doesn't come cheap.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.59,0:13:09.26,sign_18616_210_Outlet,text,0,0,0,,{\frz11.11\fax-0.3\pos(375,130)\fsp6}OUTLET
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there are notches all around\Nthe edges to make opening the bag easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How convenient. Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.52,sign_19087_218_Healthy__Family_,text,0,0,0,,Healthy! Family Planning
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This material.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's interesting how it\Nstretches and contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, there's some\Nkind of slimy liquid inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing anything wrong, but\Nsomehow this feels kind of immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to use this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, it looks like there's\Na piece of paper in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's surprisingly simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness for these diagrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a truly ingenious\Nproduct, Mr. Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will protect against diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should buy them in bulk and hand\Nthem out in the entertainment quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whew, more happy customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.18,0:13:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like you're lighter than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a regular who\Ncomes by in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to overlook\Nher little fits of mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that ends today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who\NI am, you wretched box?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring that thing apart! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Graceful, Miss Suori's antics\Nhave been getting out of hand lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As usual, the little girl showed up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, you promised me that\Nyou'd come home today. Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying this is for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I had your figure, Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move on my own, so it's not\Nmy fault they decided to put me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But boy, am I glad I'm a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I get the usual?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.06,0:15:23.10,sign_22108_255_Men_s_Underwear,text,0,0,0,,Men's Underwear
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I can't get enough\Nof this liquid hair soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time I use it, it makes\Nmy hair feel glossy and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's why I've been installed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely didn't stock up on these\Nproducts just so I'd be brought in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.82,0:15:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been shedding like crazy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it because your\Nnew coat's growing in?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, on top of that, I'm aching all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, it's almost mating season.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll stock up on fur wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use this to make\Nmy coat look amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then all the males\Nwill pay attention to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:16:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but it makes\Nyour scent irresistible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One whiff and my boyfriend\Ngot all hot and bothered,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though it wasn't mating season.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only in the bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like that hands-on-hip pose is so\Nuniversal, they even do it in other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cold one after a hot bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What more can you ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I please have one too, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go with\Nthe brown drink today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got the perfect amount of sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a bath, it's got to be\Nfruit or coffee-flavored milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight from the bottle, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bathhouse special.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.76,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\pos(545,125)}Vending
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.76,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\c&H4D4C4E&\an2\pos(490,170)\fs20}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa, what do these numbers mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They change whenever you buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're lucky and the numbers end up the\Nsame, you can get another item for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People say if you're\Nlucky enough to win here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then happiness will follow\Nyou for the rest of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to try, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, why don't we\Nstart you off with a water?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I worked up the nerve to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry for being\Nsuch a bad daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy that you've come home, dear.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.17,0:17:13.13,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\pos(545,125)}Vending
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.17,0:17:13.13,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\c&H354E5B&\an2\pos(490,170)\fs20}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only need one more number to match!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last one's the hardest.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.34,0:17:21.81,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\pos(545,125)}Vending
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.34,0:17:21.81,sign_14409_157_Vending,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\c&H354E5B&\an2\pos(490,170)\fs20}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven! Seven! Seven! Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I'm never that lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make your decision, May.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you might run out\Nof time to get your free item.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this is for you, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're giving your prize to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, you don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad the day's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only make you\Nhappy for a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.23,0:17:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Grandpa, I've been feeling happy\Nall day because I'm with you and Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumor about the prize was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it a coincidence that little\NMay hit the jackpot just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, some things are better left unsaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that you can use an ability called
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mimicry to blend in\Nwith your surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's quite the handy skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you could sit right there with it\Nactive and no one would ever notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've confirmed your ability, I\Nhave a request I'd like to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to stake out\Nthe area where a number of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crimes have taken place so you\Ncan identify the perpetrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we begin the operation,\NI'd like to see more of your mimicry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This spot's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a clear view of\Nthe Hunters Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't the director say he\Nwas borrowing him for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to help around here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to help out around\Nthe Hunters Association today
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can meet up with Boxo\Nwhenever he's ready to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a rare sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo isn't with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out he's helping\Nout the director today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so? That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a nice, peaceful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was looking forward\Nto some fruit juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's a big, dumb, stupid jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't say anything nice,\Nyou shouldn't say it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who it is, the booby monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before, it's Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you given any more\Nthought to my offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Lammis, and you\Nshould just give up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never going to give you Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the amount I'm offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your family could\Nfurther it away for three
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,generations and still\Nnot run out of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Boxo isn't my\Nproperty, so he's not mine to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, money alone would\Nnever be enough to replace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like you're his friend, but\Nyou want to keep Boxxo all to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't he be much\Nhappier spending the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of his life with me and\Nmy family's magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,residence instead of wasting\Nhis time getting lugged
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around by some stumpy\Nwoman with no sex appeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a stumpy woman with no sex appeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that's rich\Ncoming from you, Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have plenty to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know Mother has\Neven bigger ones than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, poor Miss Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has no idea that the\NMadam's been patting her bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can lay this issue to breast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamouries, can I ask you a\Nquestion about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it, but only if you\Nstart calling me by my actual name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine then, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a simple magic tool, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what exactly is\Ngoing on inside there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to tell you the truth, I'm not\Nreally that sure what Boxxo is either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he understands what people say, and\Nhe can even respond like he gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me, he's the same as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how you think of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it there for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one day, Boxo will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you'll open your\Neyes to the greatness that is Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Boxo's not here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So head back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but I'll be back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll let you\Ncontinue taking care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to polish him\Nup nice and shiny for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's just me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems Suori's been a\Nlot more talkative than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guaxo, how long have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.97,0:21:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have spoken up sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, all sorts of stuff happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna hear about it? Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.82,0:22:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you next time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs29\pos(278,300)\fsp6}Boxxo Is Abducted
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

